# Code Standards (5 Rules)

## 53. Agent Rules File
Every repo MUST have CLAUDE.md at root, .cursor/rules/*.mdc, and AGENTS.md.

## 54. Size Limits
Components ~200 lines max, Pages ~150 lines max, Functions ~50 lines max. Split larger files.

## 55. Structure
NO copied blocks - use design tokens. NO duplicate components for variants. Extend with props.

## 56. Zero JS Default
Astro components by default. React/Vue ONLY for real interactivity. Use Astro islands sparingly.

## 58. Single Config Source
ONE place for each config: site name in site.ts, phone in contact.ts, colors in brand.ts.
